{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22838","headline":"宿西林寺早赴东林满上人之会因寄崔二十二员外 · 白居易","name":"宿西林寺早赴东林满上人之会因寄崔二十二员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谪辞魏阙鵷鸾隔，老入庐山麋鹿随。\n薄暮萧条投寺宿，凌晨清净与僧期。\n双林我起闻钟後，只日君趋入阁时。\n鹏鷃高低分皆定，莫劳心力远相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}